# Files that are gitignored but must exist in a worktree for it to build and
# run. Without these, an isolated agent gets a checkout that cannot compile,
# and burns turns rediscovering why.
#
# Runtime sharing is handled by createWorkspace(), which links ignored .env
# files, .vercel/project.json, and .claude/settings.local.json to the canonical checkout.
# Do not list them here: copying would turn live shared inputs into stale copies.

# Node version pin — the repo auto-switches via fnm; without it a worktree
# lands on the machine default (v26) while every CI job pins 22 (grep
# `node-version` in .github/workflows/*.yml and `cimg/node` in
# .circleci/config.yml — the workflow count that used to sit here rotted).
.node-version

# Local editor/tooling config that is ignored but harmless and useful.
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/extensions.json

# The incremental typecheck cache. Gitignored machine state, and exactly why
# the workspace door has to carry it: without it a new worktree's first
# typecheck is a cold full run (~8,700 files, several GB). Measured 2026-09-05.
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
